  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span><span><span><span>模組繁體中文化資源包</span></span></span></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-weight:600\">Traditional Chinese Localization Resource Package</span></p><div>&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;</div><p><span><span><span><span>以資源包形式載入，即可享受繁體中文化模組</span></span></span></span></p><p>Loaded in the form of a resource pack to support traditional Chinese cultural mods</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#030\"><strong>你想的到的「熱門模組」，都繁體中文化完成並加進這資源包中，輕輕鬆鬆就可遊玩模組，不再被語言所勸退。</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">1.18版 正式支援，目前模組數<span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#00f\">190</span>個</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">1.16版v5之後 與<span style=\"font-size:36px\"> RPMTW</span>整併 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">最新版支援 <span style=\"color:#00f;font-size:36px\">1410&nbsp;</span>個模組&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:10px\">*1.17直接使用，會有意想不到的效果</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">1.12.2版v19之後 與 RPMTW整併 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">最新版支援模組共<span style=\"color:#00f;font-size:36px\">1567</span>個</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">1.15版 不再更新 支援共<span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#00f\">255</span>個&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>若有興趣參與翻譯者</p><p><strong>1.16/1.12版</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>可至 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fresourcepack-mod-zhtw\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://crowdin.com/project/resourcepack-mod-zhtw</a></p><p>相關Discord網址：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f5xApZtgV2u\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.com/invite/5xApZtgV2</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/XIKiG--AwNA?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>支援列表 Support list</p><h2><br><a href=\"https://github.com/chesterccj305/Mods-zh_tw-Lang-Pack/tree/main/1.12.2/assets\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多請參考 source&nbsp;&nbsp;</a></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">特別感謝&nbsp;Special thanks to</span></p><h3><a href=\"https://github.com/zica87\" rel=\"nofollow\">zica87</a></h3><h3><a href=\"https://github.com/Jeffku0107\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jeffku0107&nbsp;</a>旺財</h3><h3><a href=\"https://github.com/Nanamiya738\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nanamiya738</a></h3><h3><a href=\"https://github.com/SiongSng\" rel=\"nofollow\">SiongSng</a>&nbsp;菘菘</h3><h3><a href=\"https://github.com/VHlqg\" rel=\"nofollow\">VHlqg</a></h3><h3><a href=\"https://github.com/peakChanger\" rel=\"nofollow\">peakChanger</a></h3><h3><a href=\"https://github.com/yappy2000d\" rel=\"nofollow\">yappy2000d</a></h3><p>等33位參與翻譯 更多人員參考<a href=\"https://github.com/chesterccj305/Mods-zh_tw-Lang-Pack/graphs/contributors\" rel=\"nofollow\">網址</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><span><br></span>v2版</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>簡體中文漢化資源包</h2><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/simplified-chinese-localization-resource-package\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/simplified-chinese-localization-resource-package</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/i18nupdatemod\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/i18nupdatemod</a>&nbsp;</p><p>在<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcreativecommons.org%252flicenses%252fby-nc-sa%252f4.0%252fdeed.zh\" rel=\"nofollow\">知識共享署名-非商業性使用-相同方式共享4.0國際許可協議</a>之下基於<a href=\"https://github.com/CFPAOrg/Minecraft-Mod-Language-Package\" rel=\"nofollow\">簡體中文包</a>繁化</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>v1版</p><p>黒羽紫音</p><p>danny600306、 Johnsonyan、龜龜、 林阿爸、土窯雞沒左手、擬珊瑚蛇、小江、閒者納孜、默默無名的邊緣人</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
